+
+## Native DLSS Neural Rendering
+
+Imported from lunks/dxvk-remix-plus-dlssnr commit fc4de144b38e3af508ed99a99864d0a6dc26fa35. The pass enhances resolved HDR color after the selected upscaler, including Ray Reconstruction, and restores HDR before post-processing.
+
+- `src/dxvk/dxvk_objects.h` and `src/dxvk/dxvk_device.cpp`: own the NR pass and release its NGX context before device teardown.
+- `src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_context.cpp` and `.h`: dispatch NR after upscaling; reset temporal history when the internal upscaler changes.
+- `src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_types.h` and `src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui.cpp`: expose the pass stage and its controls.
+- `src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_auto_exposure.cpp`: initialize the exposure texture to neutral before its first read by NR.
+- `src/dxvk/meson.build`: register the NR pass and NGX wrapper; their shaders are discovered automatically.
+- `src/meson.build` and `meson.build`: build and package the required `remix_nvngx.dll` companion.
+- `meson.build` and `tests/rtx/meson.build`: enter optional private source directories only when their `meson.build` exists; dependency downloads may create these directories without source.
